AUDIO: 'This is the Samsung Moving Style, and I\'m going to be frank with you. I had never heard about this product until Samsung offered to send a review unit so I could check it out for you guys. And I got to be honest, it was not what I expected. I thought it was just going to be some Samsung TV on wheels, but it\'s'

[00:12] [scene:talk]
