AUDIO: 'cases we found for this thing, let\'s get the nerdy stuff out of the way. The Moving Style is a 27-in QHD touchscreen, so 1440p, not 4K, and I\'ll get back to that, with a 120 Hz refresh rate, HDR'

[00:55] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: '10+, and surprisingly beefy speakers with Dolby Atmos support. It runs Samsung\'s own smart TV platform Tizen, so Netflix, YouTube, Disney Plus, it\'s all right there out of the box, and of'

