VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'course you can install more apps on top of that. The screen sits on a rolling stand, comes off with a single click, flips into portrait mode, and here\'s the real party trick, it has a built-in battery that\'s good for about 3 hours.'

[01:21] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'For connectivity, you\'ve got Wi-Fi, Bluetooth, USB-C, and a full-sized HDMI port, and all of that comes in at about $1,199. Right, enough yapping, let\'s talk about'

