VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'while eating. Just by rolling the stand around the kitchen, no hunting for outlets, no cable hassle because battery. And that\'s when it clicked for me. This is not just a TV on wheels, this is a screen that you can just grab around the house with you while you\'re'

